          "schema_type": "LegalService",
          "seo_title": "Special Education and IEP Advocacy | North Carolina Legal Services",
          "seo_description": "At NCLS, we are committed to supporting families navigating the Individualized Education Program (IEP) process and other special education services. Our team provides guidance and representation to ensure every child receives the educational support they are entitled to under the Individuals with Disabilities Education Act (IDEA), the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA), Section 504, and more.",
          "canonical_path": "/services/special-education-and-iep-advocacy",
