          "seo_keywords": "IEP violations North Carolina, Special education rights NC, IDEA compliance, Section 504 rights, IEP evaluation timeline, Special education evaluation, IEP eligibility requirements, IEP goals and objectives, Free Appropriate Public Education, Special education complaints NC, Due process hearing NC, Independent Educational Evaluation, Child Find obligation, IEP meeting rights, Special education services NC, Disability discrimination in schools, Special education advocacy, Parent rights in IEP process, Special education law NC, Education rights for disabled students",
