          "seo_title": "North Carolina LLC vs. Sole Proprietorship",
          "seo_description": "Compare LLCs and sole proprietorships in North Carolina, including liability protection, taxes, costs, maintenance, and growth considerations.",
          "seo_keywords": "North Carolina LLC, sole proprietorship NC, LLC vs sole proprietor, start a business North Carolina, business formation NC, operating agreement",
          "canonical_url": null,
